      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Capacity is the constraint,&rdquo; said Jensen Huang, founder and CEO of NVIDIA. &ldquo;Our supply chain partners are the world&rsquo;s best manufacturers.",
